  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/be97e681-448f-433b-aeca-11f624626b3e-image.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 142px;\" /></p><p>For balancing in basic medium add equal number of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>&#8854;</mo></msup></math>. That of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>&#8854;</mo></msup><mo>&#10230;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>8</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>&#8854;</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>8</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>&#8854;</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>